@startuml Kafka SocketServer 组件关系简化图

!define LIGHTBLUE #E1F5FE
!define LIGHTGREEN #E8F5E8
!define LIGHTYELLOW #FFF9C4
!define LIGHTPINK #FCE4EC

title Kafka SocketServer 和 RequestChannel 组件关系简化图

' 客户端
actor "Kafka Client" as Client LIGHTBLUE

' 网络层
package "SocketServer" as SocketServer LIGHTGREEN {
  component "Acceptor" as Acceptor
  component "Processor Pool" as ProcessorPool
}

' 请求通道层
package "RequestChannel" as RequestChannel LIGHTYELLOW {
  component "Request Queue" as ReqQueue
  component "Response Routing" as ResponseRouting
}

' 业务处理层
package "Request Handlers" as Handlers LIGHTPINK {
  component "Handler Pool" as HandlerPool
  component "KafkaApis" as APIs
}

' 主要数据流
Client --> Acceptor : 1. TCP 连接
Acceptor --> ProcessorPool : 2. 分发连接
ProcessorPool --> ReqQueue : 3. 发送请求
ReqQueue --> HandlerPool : 4. 取出请求
HandlerPool --> APIs : 5. 处理请求
APIs --> ResponseRouting : 6. 发送响应
ResponseRouting --> ProcessorPool : 7. 路由响应
ProcessorPool --> Client : 8. 返回响应

' 内部关系
Acceptor .down.> ProcessorPool : 管理
ResponseRouting .up.> ProcessorPool : 映射

' 注释
note right of Acceptor
  负责接受新连接
  每个监听器一个线程
end note

note right of ProcessorPool
  N 个 Processor 线程
  处理网络 I/O
  支持动态扩展
end note

note bottom of ReqQueue
  阻塞队列
  缓冲待处理请求
  支持背压机制
end note

note right of HandlerPool
  M 个 Handler 线程
  异步处理业务逻辑
end note

note bottom of ResponseRouting
  根据 processor ID
  精确路由响应
end note

' 性能指标
component "Metrics" as Metrics
Acceptor ..> Metrics : 连接指标
ProcessorPool ..> Metrics : I/O 指标
ReqQueue ..> Metrics : 队列指标
HandlerPool ..> Metrics : 处理指标

note right of Metrics
  性能监控
  - 连接数
  - 队列大小
  - 处理延迟
  - 吞吐量
end note

@enduml
